 "description": "The history of Solaris is reinvented with the birth of the Solaris 74. Over the years, the design and development of our 22-meter yachts have left their mark on the yard: Solaris has created several models, always being more innovative and performing. Each Solaris yacht has satisfied the owners needs and ambitions, offering reliable and easy offshore sailing.",
